  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yeetegereza yaabona abakombe nga bata ebirabo byaibwe mu kifo omuteebwa ebirabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabona namwandu omwavu ng'ataamu budhegedhege bubiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabakoba ati: “Bwenebwene ka mbakobere namwandu ono omwavu atairemu okusinga boonaboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba bale batoirenga ku bingi bye bali nabyo, aye ono mu bwavu bwe aghaireyo kyonakyona ky'ali nakyo mu bulamu bwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bwe baali boogera ku isinzizo engeri ye lyazimbibwamu n'amabaale ag'omughendo agaboneka obulungi, n'ebirabo abantu bye baagha, yaabakoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ebiseera biidha, ebyo bye mubona ghalobe kubaagho ibaale lisigala ku liinaalyo nga tirisuuliibwa ghansi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamubuuza bati: “Mwegeresa, bino biribaagho li, era kamanhiso ki akalibaagho nga biri kumpi kubaagho?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaabairamu ati: “Mwekuume, ti kulwa nga babaghabya kuba ghalibonekagho abantu kamaala abalyeyeta eriina lyange nga bakoba bati, ‘Ninze oyo,’ era bati, ‘Ekiseera kituuse!’ Aye timubanonerezanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate bwe muwulira ku ntalo ni ku bwegugungo timudhugumiranga, kuba ebintu ebyo biri n'okusooka okubaagho, aye tikitegeeza kiti mangu ago enkomerero eriba ng'etuuka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaabakoba ati: “Eighanga lirirumba eighanga erindi, obwakyabazinga bwalumba obwakyabazinga obundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghalibaagho musisi ow'amaani, ghaabaagho endhala n'endwaire ya kawumpuli mu biketezo kamaala, era ghabaagho ebitiisa n'obumanhiso obw'amaani okuva mu igulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ng'ebyo byonabyona bikaali kubaagho, balibagema baabadaazadaaza, baabaghaayo mu mikono gya ab'obuyinza mu sinagoga ni mu makomera, baabaseeghayo ye bakyabazinga ni y'abafuzi abandi, ku lwange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kino kiribasobozesa okugha obudhulizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukite mu myoyo gyaimwe obuteetegekera kya kwiramu ng'ekiseera kikaali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.11+LUK.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 12:11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba ninze ndibagha engeri ey'okwogera n'amagezi, nga ku bazigu baimwe ghazira aghanga kubitakania waire kubiroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era muligheebwayo abazaire baimwe, baganda baimwe, ab'ekika kyaimwe, mikwano gyaimwe, era baliita abandi ku imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boonaboona balibakyagha ku lw'eriina lyange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ghazira luviiri lwa ku mutwe gwaimwe luja kuzikirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kuguma kwaimwe mwe muliwoneza obulamu bwaimwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye bwe mubonanga ab'amagye nga bali agho beezungulwire Yerusalemu, ng'olwo mumanha muti okuzikirizibwa kwakyo kutuuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'olwo abali mu Buyudaaya balumukira mu nsozi, ng'abali mu kibuga bavaamu, era ababanga mu kyalo bataingiranga mu kibuga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba edho n'edhiriba enaku edh'okubonereza n'okutuukiriza ebyaghandiikibwa byonabyona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 9:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga bakagwireku abaliba enda, n'abaliba bonsa mu nnaku edho kuba okudaagadaaga okw'amaani kuja kuba ku nsi eno n'obusungu bwa Katonda bwike ku bantu bano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi balibaita n'empiima, abandi balitwalibwa mu maghanga goonagoona nga banhage, era Yerusalemu kiriniinirirwa abamaghanga agandi okutuusa enaku edh'abamaghanga agandi lwe dhiriwaaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghalibaagho obumanhiso ku ndhuba, ku mwezi ni ku muunienie, ate ku nsi ghalibaagho okweraliikirira mu maghanga, n'okusoberwa olw'okuduma okw'amayengo n'enhandha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.13.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 13:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.32.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 32:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.2.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoe 2:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
